Nothing whatsoever!

2874
02:36:14,470 --> 02:36:15,447
OH.

2875
02:36:15,471 --> 02:36:17,556
He asked me to go driving again.

2876
02:36:18,057 --> 02:36:23,228
Heaven knows what mama's going to say, but...| don't even care!

2877
02:36:24,646 --> 02:36:29,151
Louisa and l... walked all around the old house.

2878
02:36:29,818 --> 02:36:31,938
Remembered all of the summers we had spent together as

2879
02:36:32,196 --> 02:36:38,243
girls... some of the lilac bushes that we planted years ago

2880
02:36:40,496 --> 02:36:45,250
| don't know... I've just never had such a wonderful day!

2881
02:36:45,626 --> 02:36:47,252
Pauline, I'm so pleased!

