2953
02:40:24,595 --> 02:40:26,595
You had no business interfering here, Miss Shirley.

2954
02:40:27,389 --> 02:40:30,225
Emmeline is far too easily influenced for her own good.

2955
02:40:31,935 --> 02:40:34,187
But under the circumstances l

