Thank you.

2981
02:41:55,310 --> 02:42:00,399
Forgive all evil toward me of all men Deed or device to hurt me.

2982
02:42:01,233 --> 02:42:04,486
Yea | would not bear one heart unreconciled With mine

2983
02:42:04,986 --> 02:42:09,366
when mine is cold | will not take death's hand With any soil

2984
02:42:09,658 --> 02:42:13,120
of hate or wrath or wrong about me, but being friends with this

2985
02:42:13,495 --> 02:42:19,876
past World, pass from it in the general peace of love...

2986
02:42:50,031 --> 02:42:51,491
Thank you.

2987
02:42:51,825 --> 02:42:55,203
Thank you all so much for your... well... overwhelming

2988
02:42:55,579 --> 02:42:57,372
support for this evening's benefit.

2989
02:42:58,123 --> 02:43:01,251
| would now like to introduce to you, KLC's brilliant,

2990
02:43:01,543 --> 02:43:02,794
young English professor.

2991
02:43:03,545 --> 02:43:06,923
An individual who has overseen every last inch of this

2992
