production and whose inspired direction has brought forth

2993
02:43:11,511 --> 02:43:14,806
such magnificent performances from your daughters.

2994
02:43:15,807 --> 02:43:18,059
Miss Anne Shirley!

2995
02:43:27,903 --> 02:43:31,740
Miss Shirley, on behalf of the King's County Board of.

2996
02:43:32,073 --> 02:43:34,993
Education, it gives me very great pleasure

2997
02:43:35,535 --> 02:43:37,829
to present you with this cheque.

2998
02:43:38,163 --> 02:43:42,834
The proceeds of this evening's exciting event made out to the.

2999
02:43:43,168 --> 02:43:47,589
Kingsport Ladies College in the amount of two thousand,

3000
02:43:48,006 --> 02:43:50,926
five hundred dollars!

