02:43:56,014 --> 02:43:57,849
Thank you ladies and gentlemen.

3002
02:43:58,683 --> 02:44:01,812
It would be impossible for me to speak without having by my side

3003
02:44:02,437 --> 02:44:05,190
the three other energetic supporters of tonight's event.

3004
02:44:05,732 --> 02:44:09,694
Miss Kerr, Miss MacKay, and especially our beloved

3005
02:44:10,028 --> 02:44:12,489
principal, Miss Katherine Brooke; Who have all worked so

3006
02:44:12,781 --> 02:44:15,492
tirelessly on this production.

3007
02:44:35,971 --> 02:44:38,306
It was with great trepidation that | began my year here

3008
