3017
02:45:20,432 --> 02:45:23,268
| can't thank you enough for what you've done for my Myra.

3018
02:45:23,602 --> 02:45:24,871
She's gotten along better this term than she has

3019
02:45:24,895 --> 02:45:26,271
ina long time.

