02:45:26,605 --> 02:45:27,605
She's a... joy to teach!

3021
02:45:27,939 --> 02:45:28,916
Thank you!

3022
02:45:28,940 --> 02:45:32,611
| just hope they all realize what a jewel you are, my dear.

3023
02:45:33,612 --> 02:45:35,772
| know some of the other Pringles have been abominable,

3024
02:45:35,822 --> 02:45:37,282
but | don't care what they say.

3025
02:45:37,616 --> 02:45:39,367
