You brought back SO many memories!

3029
02:45:45,332 --> 02:45:46,332
Congratulations, my dear!

3030
02:45:46,541 --> 02:45:48,043
Thank you for your kind support.

3031
02:45:48,418 --> 02:45:50,712
Papa... Papa... What did you think?

3032
02:45:51,212 --> 02:45:53,381
You were an angel that stole away everyone's heart,

3033
