3040
02:46:09,940 --> 02:46:12,859
Looks like you single-handedly routed the entire Pringle clan.

3041
02:46:13,276 --> 02:46:16,905
Well, let's just say the winds of persecution have blown over.

3042
02:46:17,280 --> 02:46:18,257
Thank you, Sir.

