3055
02:46:42,847 --> 02:46:44,182
Thank you!

3056
02:46:44,557 --> 02:46:46,142
Good night Emmeline.

3057
02:46:46,476 --> 02:46:47,476
Good night.

3058
02:46:51,481 --> 02:46:53,361
Miss Brooke generously left the light on for us!

3059
02:46:53,775 --> 02:46:55,819
She must be in a good mood!

3060
02:46:56,569 --> 02:46:57,569
Settle down.

3061
02:46:57,779 --> 02:46:59,499
I'll be along shortly to tuck you girls in.

3062
02:47:16,256 --> 02:47:20,218
Isn't that ring around the moon enchanting?

3063
02:47:20,760 --> 02:47:25,515
I've seen a good many moons in my time.

3064
02:47:30,228 --> 02:47:31,730
You haven't seen this one.

3065
02:47:33,815 --> 02:47:34,815
Sit down!

3066
02:47:35,108 --> 02:47:37,986
