3067
02:47:39,279 --> 02:47:41,781
Wasn't it a marvellous evening?

3068
02:47:42,323 --> 02:47:45,618
Don't make a fool out of yourself, please.

3069
02:47:50,749 --> 02:47:54,669
It was thought in ancient times that when a man and a woman sat

3070
02:47:55,170 --> 02:47:58,506
under such a moon, they would be bonded together

3071
02:47:58,965 --> 02:48:02,135
in love for eternity.

3072
02:48:02,469 --> 02:48:10,469
Love... if | died tomorrow, not one living soul would miss me.

3073
02:48:15,356 --> 02:48:19,152
What is it you want, Anne Shirley?

3074
02:48:19,527 --> 02:48:22,280
To be your friend.

3075
02:48:24,365 --> 02:48:25,492
| don't have friends.

3076
02:48:27,994 --> 02:48:30,474
| don't have your notable gift for doing the queen act - always

3077
