3079
02:48:37,504 --> 02:48:39,964
Well I'm going to be frank.

3080
02:48:40,298 --> 02:48:42,926
It's your own fault that no one likes you!

3081
02:48:43,259 --> 02:48:45,970
Katherine Brooke, you are all prickles and stings!

3082
02:48:46,304 --> 02:48:51,059
| know I'm unsocial and people hate me.

3083
02:48:52,477 --> 02:48:54,979
Do you think it doesn't hurt that I'm always neglected

3084
02:48:55,313 --> 02:48:56,773
and overlooked at social functions?

3085
02:48:57,315 --> 02:48:59,651
