3088
02:49:04,447 --> 02:49:07,075
| remember every single one.

3089
02:49:07,450 --> 02:49:12,080
For fifteen years | had to endure relatives who cared as

3090
02:49:12,455 --> 02:49:15,834
little for me as my dead parents!

3091
02:49:16,292 --> 02:49:18,837
| lived in third-rate boarding houses that froze in winter

3092
02:49:19,295 --> 02:49:21,089
and stank in summer!

3093
02:49:22,132 --> 02:49:26,886
