3094
02:49:27,303 --> 02:49:31,307
Fortunately, | had my grades.

3095
02:49:32,016 --> 02:49:36,062
| made it through college and | paid back every cent!

3096
02:49:36,396 --> 02:49:38,106
Oh yes, I'm independent now.

3097
02:49:38,982 --> 02:49:41,192
The truth is, | hate teaching!

3098
02:49:46,614 --> 02:49:51,536
But there's nothing else | can do!

3099
02:49:53,955 --> 02:49:54,598
Look at you.

3100
02:49:54,622 --> 02:49:56,291
Little messenger of optimism.

3101
02:49:56,875 --> 02:49:58,126
But how long will it last?

3102
02:49:58,793 --> 02:50:00,295
Five?

3103
02:50:00,753 --> 02:50:02,073
Maybe ten years before you wither

3104
02:50:02,255 --> 02:50:07,468
inside of this... endless monotony.

3105
02:50:07,927 --> 02:50:10,930
Prepare to join the ranks of cold, uninteresting spinsters

3106
02:50:11,389 --> 02:50:15,143
who have chosen a professional career, Anne Shirley!

3107
02:50:29,741 --> 02:50:32,535
"and in particular, the performance of Emmeline Harris

3108
02:50:32,869 --> 02:50:35,538
